WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.910
This view joins employees to departments and sales
orders It aggregates

00:00:05.923 --> 00:00:11.714
orders and sales amount One output row represents
one employee

00:00:13.459 --> 00:00:18.972
Because this definition can support several
operations reports publishing it as a reusable view

00:00:18.985 --> 00:00:19.814
is reasonable
